        "name": "Sky Temple"
      }
    ],
    "explanation": "Deathwing excels on Maps where the Objective gives vision and needs to be channeled (so Cursed Hollow and Garden of Terror) because he can use Skyfall at Level 7 to interrupt enemy Heroes without exposing himself.\n\nWhile he is fine being in lane on his own, we do not recommend playing him on big Maps where teams tend to split a lot because Deathwing works best when accompanied by other Heroes who can setup for Molten Flame.\n\nContrary to other global Heroes, he does not provide much value on big Maps because the time it takes for Deathwing to use Dragonflight for going from a lane to another is too slow."
